[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Import Windows XP Files
Comment=Use the original Windows XP artwork, fonts and sounds from your own XP CD or files
Exec=whistler-import-xp %f
Icon=system-software-install
Categories=Settings;DesktopSettings;
X-Whistler-Folder=Accessories/System Tools
MimeType=application/x-cd-image;application/x-iso9660-image;
